1
00:00:03,189 --> 00:00:04,795
Open Tools, Recipes.

2
00:00:04,795 --> 00:00:07,081
Recipes are grouped by feature.

3
00:00:07,081 --> 00:00:11,405
Each one has a name, tags, and a description of what it creates,

4
00:00:11,405 --> 00:00:13,629
so you know before you run it.

5
00:00:14,093 --> 00:00:17,995
Type in the Search box to find a recipe by name or tag.

6
00:00:17,995 --> 00:00:22,153
Run starts a recipe and reports the result when it is done.

7
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:24,873
Recipes can also be pasted in.

8
00:00:24,873 --> 00:00:27,583
Open Tools, Deployments, JSON Import.

9
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:32,436
The editor suggests the steps and their settings as you type, and marks

10
00:00:32,436 --> 00:00:34,705
mistakes before anything runs.

